# live-snapshot.json is the machine-readable dump of the same content as
# live-snapshot.md, plus per-verifier evidence text — 1.1 MB, which is a fifth of
# this whole repository (5.9 MB, deliberately binary-free). The readable
# rendering is committed; this is not.
#
# Regenerate with `node .research/snapshot.mjs`. Note the caveat: it reads the
# workflow's subagent transcripts under ~/.claude/projects/..., which are local
# and session-scoped. On a fresh clone there is nothing to regenerate FROM — so
# treat live-snapshot.md as the archival copy, not this file.
live-snapshot.json
